Windows 3.1 Program Manager is a 16-bit Win16 shell. 
Groups are PROGMAN.INI sections; icons are .ICO resources or
extracted from .EXE/.DLL via ExtractIcon. Window class is 
"Progman"; items are launched with WinExec or ShellExecute. 
Desktop is not Explorer; File Manager (WINFILE.EXE) is separate. 
Games (Solitaire, Minesweeper, Hearts, Reversi) ship as 
WINMINE.EXE, SOL.EXE, HEARTS.EXE, REVERSI.EXE.
